{"id":"3c0f02193bdf6c63","group":"89","path":"89/89-prop-gl-canonical-transitive.md","title":"Transitivity of the Canonical GL Relation","display":"prop-gl-canonical-transitive — Transitivity of the Canonical GL Relation","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-prop-gl-canonical-transitive","aliases":["89-prop-gl-canonical-transitive"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"prop-gl-canonical-transitive — Transitivity of the Canonical GL Relation","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-canonical-model]]","[[89-lem-lob-implies-4]]","[[89-thm-canonical-convergence]]","[[89-prop-convergence-special-cases]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-prop-gl-canonical-transitive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-prop-gl-canonical-transitive</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-gl-canonical-transitive — Transitivity of the Canonical GL Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6f068c38418e21f2\" href=\"?note=6f068c38418e21f2\" title=\"89-df-gl-canonical-model\">89-df-gl-canonical-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7c3acbd110a662db\" href=\"?note=7c3acbd110a662db\" title=\"89-lem-lob-implies-4\">89-lem-lob-implies-4</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a668d880013388bd\" href=\"?note=a668d880013388bd\" title=\"89-thm-canonical-convergence\">89-thm-canonical-convergence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fcabe060a57a2a7b\" href=\"?note=fcabe060a57a2a7b\" title=\"89-prop-convergence-special-cases\">89-prop-convergence-special-cases</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}=(W_{\\mathrm{GL}},R_{\\mathrm{GL}})\">\\(F^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}=(W_{\\mathrm{GL}},R_{\\mathrm{GL}})\\)</span> 是 GL 典范框架。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans}\">\\(\\mathrm{Trans}\\)</span> 为传递性，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 包含全部公理 4 实例。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}gl\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}transitive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Trans}(F^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}gl\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}transitive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Trans}(F^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 90–91；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>GL 导出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Box A\\to\\Box^2 A)\">\\((\\Box A\\to\\Box^2 A)\\)</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(0,2,1,0)\">\\((0,2,1,0)\\)</span> 收敛模式。典范收敛定理和特殊实例给传递性。也可直接证明：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma R\\Delta R\\Theta\">\\(\\Gamma R\\Delta R\\Theta\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\Box A\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>，4 与极大一致性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\Box A\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\Box\\Box A\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\in\\Delta\">\\(\\Box A\\in\\Delta\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Theta\">\\(A\\in\\Theta\\)</span>。传递性与存在典范自环相容，不能从传递性推出逆良基。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"6f068c38418e21f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-canonical-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-lob-implies-4","status":"resolved","id":"7c3acbd110a662db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-lob-implies-4]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-canonical-convergence","status":"resolved","id":"a668d880013388bd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-canonical-convergence]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-prop-convergence-special-cases","status":"resolved","id":"fcabe060a57a2a7b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-prop-convergence-special-cases]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}=(W_{\\mathrm{GL}},R_{\\mathrm{GL}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trans}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}gl\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}transitive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Trans}(F^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}).","display":true},{"tex":"(\\Box A\\to\\Box^2 A)","display":false},{"tex":"(0,2,1,0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma R\\Delta R\\Theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box\\Box A\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A\\in\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\Theta","display":false}],"bytes":1310,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-105","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"收敛：[[89-df-modal-iteration]] → [[89-lem-canonical-relation-powers]] → [[89-df-convergent-frame]] → [[89-thm-canonical-convergence]] → [[89-thm-convergence-completeness]]。边界：[[89-prop-gl-canonical-transitive]]、[[89-ex-gl-canonical-reflexive-world]]。"}],"outgoing":["6f068c38418e21f2","7c3acbd110a662db","a668d880013388bd","fcabe060a57a2a7b"]}